        "Outrider Kelsara's reports say Far Watch holds, and her requisitions say she's going through arrows like a siege. Both of those can't be true, and I've got to decide which one to supply.\n\nGo and look at the post itself. Don't look at the raiders, look at the wall. Count the gaps in it and the faces on it, and come back and tell me what I'm paying for.",
